What will be the output of the following Python program involving multiple inheritance and the Method Resolution Order (MRO)?<br><br><div class='code-block'>class A:
    def show(self):
        print("A")

class B(A):
    def show(self):
        print("B")
        super().show()

class C(A):
    def show(self):
        print("C")
        super().show()

class D(B, C):
    def show(self):
        print("D")
        super().show()

obj = D()
obj.show()</div>
